---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="eBook Coming Soon | IELTS Corner"
  description="The IELTS Corner eBook is still in development. Use the lessons and support pages for now."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="hero" style={`--hero-bg: url('/heroes/ebook.png');`}>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="pill">eBook</span>
        <h1>The eBook is not ready yet</h1>
        <p class="muted" style="max-width: 62ch;">
          It is still being shaped into something worth using, not just something to sell.
          The goal is a practical guide that helps IELTS and CELPIP learners study with less confusion.
        </p>
        <p class="muted" style="max-width: 62ch; margin-top: var(--s-2);">
          Until it is ready, the strongest materials are still the free lessons, the writing feedback services,
          and the skill hubs already on the site.
        </p>
        <div class="cluster" style="margin-top: var(--s-2);">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/lessons">Explore free lessons</a>
          <a class="btn" href="/blog">Read the blog</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-6);"></div>

    <div class="surface ebook-panel">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">What to use instead right now</h2>
      <p>
        If you need help today, start with one grammar, writing, or speaking lesson. If the score problem is still
        unclear after that, move to writing feedback or tutoring for direct correction.
      </p>
      <div class="cluster" style="margin-top: var(--s-2);">
        <a class="btn" href="/ai-feedback/">AI Writing Lab</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/tutoring">Tutoring</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-5);"></div>

    <div class="surface ebook-panel">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Want to hear about it later?</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">
        Join the newsletter on the home page if you want the announcement when the eBook is actually ready.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .ebook-panel {
    padding: var(--s-4);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
  }
</style>
